  "title": "Warm Korean Pecorino Kimchi Bowl",
  "description": "A delicious and crowd-pleasing Korean dish featuring pecorino and ferment-kimchi, served in a dolsot-stone-bowl, this recipe is jain-friendly and perfect for a weeknight dinner",
