  "instructions": [
    "Heat the sesame oil in a large skillet over medium heat",
    "Add the Korean chili flakes and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the kimchi and cook for 2 minutes",
    "Stir in the pecorino cheese until melted and well combined",
    "To assemble the bowls, place a scoop of cooked rice in the bottom of a dolsot-stone-bowl",
    "Add the kimchi and pecorino mixture on top of the rice",
    "Garnish with chopped green onions and toasted sesame seeds",
    "Season with salt to taste",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy"
